    "body": "<!-- flclash:changelog:begin -->\n### Features\n- **connections** Merged requests and connections; quick edit lists\n- **ui** iOS 27 transitions, press and text selection; smoother pages\n- **update** Download and install updates in the app\n- **core** One delay test timeout; VPN crash and startup fixes\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- **core** Auto-select leaves an unusable first node at once\n- **access** Keep selections a filter hides\n\n<!-- flclash:changelog:end -->\n\n<!-- flclash:changelog:json\n{\"schemaVersion\":2,\"versions\":[{\"version\":\"0.9.3\",\"tag\":\"v0.9.3\",\"date\":\"2026-11-04\",\"prerelease\":false,\"groups\":[{\"type\":\"feat\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"52b975f\",\"scope\":\"connections\",\"text\":\"Merged requests and connections; quick edit lists\"},{\"id\":\"bb47f2c\",\"scope\":\"ui\",\"text\":\"iOS 27 transitions, press and text selection; smoother pages\"},{\"id\":\"b8f84b3\",\"scope\":\"update\",\"text\":\"Download and install updates in the app\"},{\"id\":\"2a5a42c\",\"scope\":\"core\",\"text\":\"One delay test timeout; VPN crash and startup fixes\"}]},{\"type\":\"fix\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"7d5db7e\",\"scope\":\"core\",\"text\":\"Auto-select leaves an unusable first node at once\"},{\"id\":\"63aaf6d\",\"scope\":\"access\",\"text\":\"Keep selections a filter hides\"}]}]}]}\n-->\n<div align=center>\n\n[![Release Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/chen08209/FlClash/v0.9.3/total?style=flat-square&logo=github)](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/chen08209/FlClash/v0.9.3/)\n\n</div>\n\n**Download based on your OS:**\n\n<div align=left>\n<table>\n    <thead align=left>\n        <tr>\n            <th>OS</th>\n            <th>Download</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody align=left>\n        <tr>\n        <td>Android</td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.3/FlClash-0.9.3-android-arm64-v8a.apk\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/APK-ARMv8-1